        "original_id": "17218990-1627-5ed7-8bfe-9c8e8f3c46ea",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Radiohead\n- Products: \"No Surprises\", OK Computer, \"Lucky\"\n- Places: Oxfordshire, Bath, St Catherine's Court\n- Topics: recording, release\n\nFacts:\n- Radiohead recorded the song \"Lucky\" in 1995.\n- Radiohead recorded most of the album OK Computer in the historic mansion St Catherine's Court, with recording sessions in Oxfordshire and Bath between 1996 and early 1997.\n- Radiohead released \"No Surprises\" as the third and final single from their third studio album OK Computer on 12 January 1998.",
